# Not part of the Nx workspace.
#
# `.claude/` is the AI operating model (agents and skills, CLAUDE.md §5). Some
# vendored skills ship their own `package.json` and helper scripts, which Nx
# would otherwise infer as workspace projects — putting third-party assets this
# repository does not own into `nx run-many` and `nx affected`.
.claude

